{"id":"06c0295d39a97a66","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-complete-development-unique.md","title":"完整发展的存在唯一目标","display":"thm-complete-development-unique — 完整发展的存在唯一目标","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-complete-development-unique","aliases":["56-thm-complete-development-unique"],"display":"thm-complete-development-unique — 完整发展的存在唯一目标","depends_on":["[[56-df-complete-development]]","[[56-thm-finite-developments]]","[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]","[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]"],"source_section":"§4.5 Exercise 4.5.5 (FD!); §4.4 Propositions 4.4.3–4.4.7","source_printed_pages":"102–103,107–108","source_ocr_blocks":[123,124,128,129],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-complete-development-unique"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-complete-development-unique</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-complete-development-unique — 完整发展的存在唯一目标"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"298ee1b282da57bf\" href=\"?note=298ee1b282da57bf\" title=\"56-thm-finite-developments\">56-thm-finite-developments</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dcc1e9c43059f569\" href=\"?note=dcc1e9c43059f569\" title=\"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma\">56-thm-critical-pair-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.5 Exercise 4.5.5 (FD!); §4.4 Propositions 4.4.3–4.4.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"102–103,107–108"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>123</span><span>124</span><span>128</span><span>129</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为正交TRS，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CDev}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dev}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Dev}_R\\)</span> 与完整发展关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\)</span>；路径拼接、零步及残余拼接律见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a>。</li>\n<li>FD、临界对引理、Newman引理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"298ee1b282da57bf\" href=\"?note=298ee1b282da57bf\" title=\"56-thm-finite-developments\">56-thm-finite-developments</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dcc1e9c43059f569\" href=\"?note=dcc1e9c43059f569\" title=\"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma\">56-thm-critical-pair-lemma</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a>；工作于ZFC。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!t\\in T\\;s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!t\\in T\\;s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dev}_R(\\rho,U)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho\\mathbin{;}\\eta,U)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dev}_R(\\rho,U)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho\\mathbin{;}\\eta,U)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在及延长：从当前非空残余集中选位置字典序最小的 redex 继续收缩；该位置只有一个规则身份，因正交性排除了同位置不同规则。若永不停止就产生原初始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的无限发展，与 FD 矛盾；停止时残余为空。拼接律保证延长仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的发展。对零步源路径应用此过程得至少一个完整发展。</p>\n<p>唯一性使用原书的 underlining 构造，给出其完整推导链。在扩展签名中为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 增设同元数的带线副本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline f\">\\(\\underline f\\)</span>。将每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l=f(l_1,\\ldots,l_n)\\to r\">\\(l=f(l_1,\\ldots,l_n)\\to r\\)</span> 替为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline f(l_1,\\ldots,l_n)\\to r\">\\(\\underline f(l_1,\\ldots,l_n)\\to r\\)</span>：只给左部根符号加线，原未加线规则不加入该系统。把源项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 中恰好 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的头符号加线，记此有限带线项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline s_U\">\\(\\underline s_U\\)</span>。正交性保证所有内嵌标记都处在外层左部变量像内，因此这套规则恰模拟发展，每次步后的带线头恰是当前残余；它们仍是 redex 头。故其无后继状态恰好没有下划线，并对应完整发展终点。</p>\n<p>带线系统左线性仍成立；任何两带线规则的非平凡重叠擦去下划线后都会给出原系统的非平凡重叠，因而不存在。临界对引理给局部合流。在上述可达带线项集合中，发展测度下降给强正规化；该集合按带线归约封闭。Newman引理于是给这个集合的合流性。两个完整发展对应同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline s_U\">\\(\\underline s_U\\)</span> 的两个无下划线正规形；合流性迫使它们是同一项。这里没有借用待证明的原TRS整体合流。</p>\n<p>原书把 FD! 列为 Exercise 4.5.5；本笔记给出完整存在/唯一目标的推导，而非把练习题号当成已提供的证明。所有带线构造仅用于证明，本断言的完整发展含义已由前两节和上游残余接口确定。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Propositions 4.4.3–4.4.7、Theorem 4.5.4、Exercise 4.5.5 及其前文说明；已读并核对这些构造和推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-complete-development","status":"resolved","id":"b06f8242a0a4824a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-complete-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-finite-developments","status":"resolved","id":"298ee1b282da57bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-finite-developments]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-residual-transport-laws","status":"resolved","id":"b2ca2cb031a137a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-n