false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!t\\in T\\;s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dev}_R(\\rho,U)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho\\mathbin{;}\\eta,U)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline f","display":false},{"tex":"l=f(l_1,\\ldots,l_n)\\to r","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline f(l_1,\\ldots,l_n)\\to r","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline s_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline s_U","display":false}],"bytes":3502,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee363e70c7c40e08","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"工作于 ZFC，固定正交项重写系统 $R$ 及 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。有限路径集 $\\mathcal F_R$、$\\mathbf1_s$、首尾投影、可拼接路径的 $\\rho;\\eta$ 及残余传送 $\\operatorname{Res}_R$ 采用 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]] 的上游定义。完整发展关系 $\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R$ 及其存在唯一目标采用 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]。"},{"id":"e82b4135b6aba06c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定上述正交系统，$s\\in T$，$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 且 $\\operatorname{Disj}(U)$。$\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]，$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$ 与有限路径首尾投影见 [[56-df-complete-development]]，完整发展唯一目标见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]，平行关系见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]，残余拼接律见 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-complete-development-unique.md]]"},{"id":"5d7d7db404fca095","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$ 见 [[56-df-complete-development]]；完整发展的存在唯一目标与残余不变性见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance]]。"},{"id":"59e4d0955d71de93","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"完整发展和唯一目标见 [[56-df-complete-development]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]；残余传送及同位置规则唯一见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。"}],"outgoing":["b06f8242a0a4824a","298ee1b282da57bf","b2ca2cb031a137a3","dcc1e9c43059f569","edc2d7f4ffe88f2e"]}